(text "DLATCH2_J2N16 testbench (tools/kicad/gen_latch_j2n16.py, stimulus and .meas from tools/spice/latch_tb.py).\nSTIM_x (HV PWL, ideal) -> divider -> driver triode (Ra 10k + L 680u || 10k) -> divider -> x (LV DUT input): real edges and levels.\nEach output -> one divider (C1 3.9 pF per grid) -> x_LV -> load tubes, both grids on the net.\nE: 2.0 us period, high in the second half; D1 = pattern, D2 = ~D1, both change 0.5 us after E falls.\nThe plain-SPICE run of the same bench: python3 tools/spice/latch_tb.py" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 312.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "91614b2e-4c08-459a-ab01-1b26915cf2c8"))
